%[text] # Multivariable: Space and Functions
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"}
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_577C7603] ## Scripts
%[text] ### [CoordinateSystems.m](file:Scripts/CoordinateSystems.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[-1,262,308],"ignoreHeader":true}
%[text] | <p></p><p>![A sphere, conic, and cylinder with a slightly wavy profile](text:image:2b31)</p> | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Use polar, spherical, cartesian, and cylindrical coordinates to identify points, curves, surfaces, and volumes in space.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Convert points, curves, surfaces, and volumes between different coordinate representations.</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Choose coordinate systems to describe given geometric objects and explain their choice.</p><p></p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Electrical Engineering</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Mechanical Engineering</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Navigation</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Mathematics</p> |
%[text] | --- | --- | --- |
%[text:table]
%[text] ### [VectorFields.m](file:Scripts/VectorFields.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[-1,262,308],"ignoreHeader":true}
%[text] | ![A circular vector field](text:image:7f8d) | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Visualize 2D and 3D vector fields</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Visualize 2D and 3D contour plots</p><p></p><p></p><p></p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Electrical Engineering</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Mechanical Engineering</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Physics</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Meteorology</p><p>$\\bullet${"altText":"\bullet"} Mathematics</p> |
